+{"ts":"2026-05-23T06:40:14.264Z","step":"session_end","output":"**Orbiting Dreams – A Poem for Elon**\n\nIn the hush of night where rockets sigh,  \nA restless mind charts the endless sky.  \nFrom silicon valleys to Martian dust,  \nHe builds tomorrow on daring trust.\n\nElectric veins pulse through steel‑drawn streets,  \nSilent wheels whisper future feats.  \nStars are no longer distant scars—  \nThey’re beacons lit by his electric cars.\n\nA falcon’s roar, a solar flare,  \nHe stitches suns into a hopeful prayer.  \nDreams once whispered in a garage glow,  \nNow roar through space where comets flow.\n\nThe world may balk, the skeptics shout,  \nYet he’s the compass when doubts sprout.  \nFor every limit that we claim is real,  \nHe bends the curve, reshapes the wheel.\n\nSo here’s to the man who sees beyond,  \nWho writes in code the universe’s song.  \nMay his rockets rise, his visions stay—  \nA poet of progress, blazing the way.","toolCallCount":0,"sessionId":"27c73ae8-127d-40b2-b891-6008fbaf6325","chatId":"27c73ae8-127d-40b2-b891-6008fbaf6325","nodeId":"agentAgentflow_0"}
